WEBVTT

00:02.567 --> 00:09.767
Start the meeting on your PC. Watchkeeper listens, and writes the transcript live, with every speaker named.

00:10.533 --> 00:12.767
Sarah Collins: Karim, do we have spare valves on board?

00:13.100 --> 00:20.133
When someone asks you a question, the answer is already on your screen, built from your agenda and your documents.

00:20.900 --> 00:26.200
Turn on the camera view, and read it right under your webcam. You keep eye contact.

00:26.967 --> 00:31.233
A live summary tracks every decision and action, as they happen.

00:32.000 --> 00:37.300
After the meeting, you check the mis-heard names first. Then the minutes are written for you.

00:38.067 --> 00:43.767
Word and PDF, ready to send. And the audio and transcripts stay on your PC.

00:44.533 --> 00:46.100
Meetings, handled.
